985	// Mission Control drilldown (PANEL_V3_SPEC.md §3.1) — last N missions for ONE
986	// bot, newest first, fetched only when a driver actually opens that card's
987	// drilldown (not on the fast 3s poll — see panel-client.js). Reads the one
988	// file directly rather than routing through readMissionEntries()'s
989	// read-every-file-then-filter shape, since a drilldown only ever wants one
990	// bot's history and there is no reason to read the other seven files to get
991	// it. A missing file (G2 not shipped yet for THIS bot, or shipped but this
992	// bot has never had a task finish) is the honest "no mission history yet"
993	// state, not an error — same tolerant contract as every other v3 reader
994	// above.
995	const MISSION_HISTORY_CAP = 30;
