1113	// per tile. missing:true when Vault has never run (no ground truth exists,
1114	// same rule the #vault section itself already follows); ok:false when the
1115	// snapshot exists but failed to read/parse (a real failure worth surfacing,
1116	// distinct from "never audited"); otherwise the summed total plus Vault's own
1117	// freshly-computed ageMs/staleMs so the client can flag a stale snapshot the
1118	// same way #vault's own age line does.
