8	     8	// SAFETY CONTRACT — the panel has exactly TWO write actions:
9	     9	//   POST /api/wake {bot}  -> pushes that bot's role-default task, force:false
10	    10	//   POST /api/stop {bot}  -> forwards POST /stop to that bot's runner
