18	    18	// the newer v3 readers) lives in cave/panel-data.mjs, imported below as plain
19	    19	// named functions — this file never touches a bot's status shape directly.
20	    20	// The entire client-side script lives in cave/panel-client.js, served
21	    21	// statically via GET /panel.js rather than inlined into the HTML this file
22	    22	// renders (kills the double-escaping bug class the architecture note
